            "title": "財經｜滙豐上調香港今年GDP預測至4.5%  看好貿易及消費表現",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"財經｜滙豐上調香港今年GDP預測至4.5%  看好貿易及消費表現\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/49b0d0ce980e8683d284f9ba2e12c935cf1463332015d8c1421a6fba516afa28/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">財經｜滙豐上調香港今年GDP預測至4.5%  看好貿易及消費表現</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">滙豐環球投資研究報告指，本港經濟基礎較預期穩固，將2026年經濟增長預測由3.8%調高至4.5%，並維持2027年增長預測於3%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">該行指出，雖然外圍環境仍有不明朗因素，香港貨物貿易保持韌性，上半年出口及進口分別按年增加26%和30%。由於半導體佔本港貨物貿易比重逾四成，AI相關需求料繼續支撐貿易；同期內地相關貿易增長37%，亦有助帶動整體表現。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">滙豐預期本地消費將維持穩定，受惠樓市回升帶來的財富效應及較穩定的貨幣環境。上半年住宅樓價較2025年底上升7.9%，零售銷售按年增長10%，主要由奢侈品及耐用品消費帶動；旅客增加及大型活動亦有助改善服務消費。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-6c43a8ee-7cf4-3483-9b1d-720793056b3d-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content